ai-digest Repository Version History
====================================

v0.2 (Release Date: TBD)
------------------------
- Document the output with screenshots of the composite image and of the
  Flask viewer, add tools/make_sample_report.py which builds the sample
  report behind them without an API key, and tools/capture_screens.py
  which captures the viewer of any stored report.
- Add SUMMARIZER_BACKEND=plain, letting the batch pipeline run without
  an Anthropic API key by building topics mechanically instead of
  calling the Claude API.
- Support custom Anthropic-compatible API URLs and Bearer authentication.

